            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-structure"} G-structure
            is
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integrability+of+G-structure"} first-order integrable
            if on the first-order
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+neighbourhoods"} infinitesimal neighbourhoods
            of any point it is equal to the canonical (trivial)
            = succeed "-structure" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
