          %h3#Examples11dSuGra 11d supergravity
          %p
            The torsion constraint for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11-dimensional+supergravity"} 11-dimensional supergravity
            is discussed for instance by
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#BergshoeffSezginTownsend87"} Bergshoeff, Sezgin &amp; Townsend 1987, (14)
          %p Here something special happens:
          %p
            The authors
            %a{:href => "#CandielloLechner93"} Candiello &amp; Lechner 1993 (5.6)
            and
            %a{:href => "#Howe97"} Howe 1997
            (see
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#CederwallGranNilssonTsimpis04"} Cederwall, Gran, Nilsson, Tsimpis 2004, section 2.4
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
