            implies the equations of motion of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/11d+supergravity"} 11d supergravity
          %h3#HeteroticSupergravity 10d Heterotic supergravity
          %p
            For
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+supergravity"} heterotic supergravity
            in 10d the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equations+of+motion"} equations of motion
            are equivalent to the condition that
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                the super-torsion of the bosonic part
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
