            %li
              %p
                the super-torsion of the odd part
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msup
                        %mi ψ
                        %mi α
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \psi^\alpha
                of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/super+vielbein"} super vielbein
                is of the form
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi 𝒟
                      %msup
                        %mi ψ
                        %mi α
                      %mo =
