              %p
                proportional to the bispinor formed by tracing the square of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gaugino"} gaugino
                field
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
